// Title: Forest Blizzard APT - File Creation Activity
// Rule ID: b92d1d19-f5c9-4ed6-bbd5-7476709dc389
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.002, detection.emerging-threats
